@startuml
title L2-042 - Bound abuse and report safe security failures
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}

actor "Library owner" as actor
box "Frontend - Loupe application / domain / api" #E0F2FE
participant "RequestNotice" as page
participant "CapabilityService" as client
end box
box "Backend - Loupe API application" #D1FADF
participant "CapabilitiesController" as controller
end box
box "Backend - Loupe Application and Domain" #ECFDF3
participant "ConsumeQuotaCommandHandler" as handler
participant "QuotaWindow" as entity
end box
box "Backend - Loupe Infrastructure" #FFF4E5
database "Library store" as db
participant "IQuotaStore / ISecurityAuditWriter adapters" as ext
end box
actor -> page : Bound abuse and report safe security failures
page -> client : server owner/IP, request class, now
client -> controller : API request middleware
note over controller : API middleware authenticates; controller binds only
controller -> handler : MediatR dispatch ConsumeQuotaCommand
handler -> db : Load / validate owner-scoped state before side effects
db --> handler : Owned state or unavailable result
handler -> ext : Atomic rolling 60 s window across instances [L2-042]
ext --> handler : Permit or next capacity time
alt exhausted class
handler --> controller : 429 + computed Retry-After; no side effect
else available capacity
handler -> db : Continue authorized operation
end
note over ext : Audit redacted events; expire after 30 days
note over controller : Safe code/message/correlation ID; no stack, SQL, paths or secrets
handler --> controller : distributed quota decision and safe diagnostics
controller --> client : Typed HTTP response / ProblemDetails
client --> page : Update state signals
page --> actor : Saved / loaded state or retained-input error
@enduml
